040120, Junker: i'm working in the ancap area. but, checked out self-def > The Free Arms Project. elists are good for certain things. but i wonder if a wiki for this group might be helpful as well.

p.s. such fun! makes me truly wish i could play.

040120, BillStClair: If The Free Arms Project wants a wiki, I'd be happy to host it, though I doubt I'd be very active in adding content. Or, Russell, you could follow the instructions at UseModSetup to set one up one your web site.

